\tag{fdip}
\title{An onsite Yukawa coupling for based cochains}
\date{2026-11-19}

\p{A scalar can change a fermion coefficient at its own site
while a link transports the coefficient to another site. Which
onsite actions respect both changes of frame, and when does their
[paired coefficient](fdip-00TJ) give a positive weight?}

